    return result
```

```python
def split(cookies, people):
    if cookies % people == 0:
        return (cookies // people, 0, "Cookies can be split evenly!")
    else:
        new_cookies = cookies - (cookies % people)
        return (new_cookies, new_cookies // people, "Cookies cannot be split evenly. Bought more cookies.")
```

